      "text": "🚨 TRAFFIC ADVISORY 🚨\n\n📍 Moosapet – Parvathnagar Traffic Diversion\n From 16.05.2026 onwards for 30 Days\n\nDue to CC Road development works from Jaya Shankar Statue to RRR Restaurant, traffic diversions are in place for smooth traffic flow.\n\n🔀 Traffic from Toddy Compound towards Parvathnagar will be diverted at Parvathnagar Junction towards Sunnam Cheruvu / 100 Feet Road.\n\n⚠️ Plan your travel in advance, use alternate routes, and follow diversion signboards.\n\n- Cyberabad Traffic Police\n\n#TrafficAdvisory #CyberabadTraffic #HyderabadTraffic #TrafficUpdate #RoadSafety #TrafficDiversion #Moosapet #Parvathnagar #Hyderabad #CommuterAlert #DriveSafe #TrafficPolice #SafeTravel #CyberabadPolice",
